## naps

`skills/lem/prompts/nap.md` follows the owner's own nap routine, a brief of his that a scheduled
job gives a fresh session three times a day, as of 2026-11-17: its falling asleep, its dream that
does not have to make sense, and its waking up, with the dream written down first, one thing made
from it and a short waking note, are kept in its words where they fit. Changes made: the nap
reads the tasks in Lem's state folder instead of the owner's sessions, its folder is in that
state folder, it commits nothing, and Lem starts it, not a scheduled job. The routine is the
owner's own and unpublished, so no license applies to it.

